{"id":"chocolate-hills","name":"Chocolate Hills","qid":"Q977422","country":"Philippines","locality":"Bohol","lat":"9.916666666","lon":"124.166666666","built":"","year":null,"year_text":"","century":"","era":"Natural formations","period":"","date_basis":"","style":"","heritage":"Tentative World Heritage Site; National Geological Monument","type":"hill","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chocolate_Hills","text":"The Chocolate Hills (Cebuano: Mga Bungtod sa Tsokolate, Filipino: Mga Tsokolateng Burol, or Mga Burol na Tsokolate) are a geological formation in the Philippine province of Bohol. A minimum of 1,260 hills, and possibly over 1,776, spread over an area of more than 50 square kilometers (20 sq mi). They are covered in green grass that turns a chocolate-brown during the dry season, hence the name.","text_source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chocolate_Hills","text_license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","real":[{"id":"gh-3a65bfaf0ad5","w":1200,"h":900,"title":"Chocolate Hills overview.JPG","o":"gh-3a65bfaf0ad5.jpg","credit":{"text":"P199","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Chocolate_Hills_overview.JPG","via":"Wikimedia Commons"}}],"depictions":[{"id":"civilization-vi--chocolate-hills","game":"civilization-vi","name":"Chocolate Hills","verified":false,"text":"","text_source":"","text_license":"","images":[{"id":"gh-p7ee5d11190e","w":584,"h":502,"o":"gh-p7ee5d11190e.png","credit":{"text":"Screenshot from Civilization VI, © 2K; Aspyr.","source":"https://civilization.fandom.com/wiki/File:Historic_Moment_Chocolate_Hills_(Civ6).png","via":"Fandom (civilization)","note":"Fandom upload by Xanthos of Thebes on 2020-07-15"}},{"id":"gh-paa0704e60a8","w":189,"h":215,"o":"gh-paa0704e60a8.png","credit":{"text":"Screenshot from Civilization VI, © 2K; Aspyr.","source":"https://civilization.fandom.com/wiki/File:Chocolate_Hills_(Civ6).png","via":"Fandom (civilization)","note":"Fandom upl